OL,3,ASix Flags shuts down X2 rollercoaster
OL,4,Aafter hundreds allege brain injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix Flags Magic Mountain, an amusement
OL,7,Fpark in California, has announced it
OL,8,Fwill permanently close a popular
OL,9,Frollercoaster after hundreds of riders
OL,10,Falleged they suffered brain injuries.
OL,12,FThe X2 rollercoaster, one of the park's
OL,13,Fmain attractions, with long wait times
OL,14,Fto ride and seats that spin 360
OL,15,Fdegrees, has been closed since July.
OL,17,FSix Flags said the ride had passed a
OL,18,Frange of safety tests, but that it had
OL,19,Fdecided to retire it because it was
OL,20,F"the right thing to do".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
